  "aiContextParagraph": "The Kupang Regent, Yosef Lede, is currently under investigation following allegations of sexual assault against a university student. Following his designation as a suspect by the East Nusa Tenggara regional police and subsequent detention, the Ministry of Home Affairs appointed Deputy Regent Aurum Titu Eki to fulfill administrative responsibilities. Political figures, including members of the House of Representatives, have called for strict oversight and potential disciplinary action, while the regent's political party, Gerindra, stated they would allow the legal process to proceed. Law enforcement officials are currently processing evidence related to the case and planning witness confrontations. Yosef Lede maintains his innocence, describing the interaction as consensual, and intends to initiate a pretrial process to contest the charges. If convicted, the regent faces a potential prison sentence of up to 12 years under existing law.",
